up to his land and to help him picking some corn.

00:00:56.461 --> 00:00:58.987
We were just about to leave the land right now!

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:21.735
- So, we're getting all this corn, stripping it down, 
putting it in a bucket, and he is gonna use this.

00:02:21.735 --> 00:02:24.509
They're gonna bring it to a mill, to mill it into flour to make bread.

00:02:25.212 --> 00:02:27.858
Some of it is gonna go to his animals to feed them.

00:02:28.245 --> 00:02:30.501
