00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:40.867
After the hard work, we had a snack from the neighbors,
 typically called bucha.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.621
They also let us pick up some fruit for the people at the Kamp.

00:04:46.506 --> 00:04:51.154
So, we are done with the harvesting, 
and we harvested ourselves a lot of things!

00:04:53.007 --> 00:04:57.892
This is all the things we take back after harvesting some corn!

00:04:57.892 --> 00:04:59.090
- Nice!

00:05:05.396 --> 00:05:07.462
